[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDBMB_3B_THUMBTACKS]
Thumbtacks

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDBMB_3B_THUMBTACKS_desc]
Enchantment: Rust, in addition to physical damage, inflicts tetanus on the enemy, causing continuous damage. However, this may also cause our logistics staff to have a chance to get tetanus.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDBMB_3B_THUMBTACKS]
大头钉

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDBMB_3B_THUMBTACKS_desc]
附魔：铁锈，在物理伤害基础上，为敌军附加破伤风效果，造成持续伤害。然而，这也会导致我方后勤员工有概率得到破伤风状态。
